  <h1 class="title">Air Conditioning—Key to Comfort</h1>

  <div class="subhead-row">
    <div class="subhead">
      Future Home Standards Will Require<br>
      Equipment for Proper Air Treatment<br>
      to Insure Comfortable Indoor Living
    </div>
    <div class="byline">
      <div class="by-name">By V. L. SHERMAN</div>
      <div class="dept">
